            "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i><strong>Fazer algo perigoso com estilo é arte...</strong></i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/550320/extras/e7b8bad0308aae07f9412d71d6c0db32.poster.avif?t=1790267308\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/550320/extras/e7b8bad0308aae07f9412d71d6c0db32.webm?t=1790267308\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/550320/extras/e7b8bad0308aae07f9412d71d6c0db32.mp4?t=1790267308\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Art of rally</strong> é uma experiência única do mesmo criador de Absolute Drift.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Corre pelo globo com cores vibrantes e estilizadas através de uma vista superior. Compete pelo primeiro lugar na tabela de líderes através de desafios diários e semanais.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Acha que consegues te tornar um mestre no art of rally?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/550320/extras/c86f879149f835e0642484f54c611e5c.webp?t=1790267308\" width=600 height=50 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Experimente a era de ouro dos ralis no modo carreira, viajando pela Finlândia, Sardenha em Itália, Noruega, Japão, Alemanha e Quênia, completando um total de 72 provas especiais de classificação.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/550320/extras/f6f3d526f13e4f643b1ea48b8a0870a1.avif?t=1790267308\" width=600 height=148 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/550320/extras/c4c2715515af3d0a31f466bf9e21888b.webp?t=1790267308\" width=600 height=50 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Controla o teu carro favorito de rali, seja dos anos 60 ou 80, seja grupo b, grupo s ou grupo a.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/550320/extras/a8fc56d67beab720540e068ece721b56.poster.avif?t=1790267308\" width=600 height=260 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/550320/extras/a8fc56d67beab720540e068ece721b56.webm?t=1790267308\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/550320/extras/a8fc56d67beab720540e068ece721b56.mp4?t=1790267308\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/550320/extras/f0ca5b9f81e487ee146abf139a591f8b.webp?t=1790267308\" width=600 height=51 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Desde opções de pilotagem para iniciantes até modos de pilotagem avançados para os pilotos mais experientes, todos os jogadores podem competir usando as suas técnicas favoritas como o famoso Scandinavian flick, contra-brecagem, travão com o pé esquerdo e travão de mão.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/550320/extras/ea2aa6145b84959e9d290b4bb88d3e81.poster.avif?t=1790267308\" width=600 height=250 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/550320/extras/ea2aa6145b84959e9d290b4bb88d3e81.webm?t=1790267308\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/550320/extras/ea2aa6145b84959e9d290b4bb88d3e81.mp4?t=1790267308\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/550320/extras/eccec1bae6f88078080a8694a8a37063.webp?t=1790267308\" width=600 height=50 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Coloca o teu nome no topo da tabela de lideres nos eventos diarios e semanais.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/550320/extras/01993e7b75d7114505df8c2f26e26ed4.avif?t=1790267308\" width=600 height=270 /></span></p>",
